{"sections":[{"slug":"六函子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"六函子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">六函子</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“六函子”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于空间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">等等</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">许多有关上同调的事实可由很少几条公理导出</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">六函子是以下三对伴随</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆像</span>"}},{"Plain":" (inverse image) - "},{"Local":{"url":"/直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直像</span>"}},{"Plain":" (direct image) <span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span> $f^* \\dashv f_*$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对于分离态射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧支集直像","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧支集直像</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">又叫紧支集前推</span>, pushforward with compact support) - <span lang=\"zh\">紧支集逆像</span> (Verdier <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span> $f_! \\vdash f^!$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">张量积与内蕴</span> Hom <span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span> $-\\otimes X \\vdash [X,-]$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这些概念通常使用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">来描述</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而最后一对函子实际上是</span> Tor <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> Ext.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴中的六函子为</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">右</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出前推","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出前推</span>"}},{"Plain":" $Rf_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">和左导出拉回</span> $Lf^*$;</li>\n<li>$Rf_! \\dashv f^!$ (<span lang=\"zh\">后者是正合函子</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">右导出</span> Hom $R\\mathcal{Hom}$ <span lang=\"zh\">和左导出张量积</span> $X\\overset{L}{\\otimes}-$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">存在自然变换</span> $f_! \\to f_*$, <span lang=\"zh\">且当</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧合映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧合映射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时为自然同构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">紧空间上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴有良好的六函子</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}